It became the makeshift base for the police and media. He threw out Jessica's mobile phone. It was never found. After scrubbing himself clean he was able to make his way outside and pretend he had no idea what was going on and he started to help with the search. He knew admitting that he had spoken with the girls would cast suspicion on him but he couldn't take the risk of lying that he hadn't seen them. It was a public place. Somebody could easily have spotted him chatting to them if he got caught lying it would have been all over. The next day he got to work cleaning the car. He got the tyres changed and removed the carpet from the car boot. He called Maxine and begged her to come home early from her trip saying he needed her to lie for him as the girls had come by the house and he would be the prime suspect if she didn't give him an alibi. He then started asking questions of police officers about DNA evidence and how long it lasted which put him straight under suspicion.
这里成了警察和媒体的临时基地。他扔掉了杰西卡的手机。手机一直没有找到。把自己清洗干净后，他得以走到外面，假装自己对发生的一切毫不知情，并开始协助搜寻。他知道承认自己和女孩们说过话会给自己招来嫌疑，但他冒不起谎称自己没见过她们的风险。这是一个公共场所。如果他被抓到说谎，而别人很容易就能看到他曾和她们聊天，那就彻底完了。第二天，他开始清洗汽车。他换了轮胎，并移除了汽车后备箱里的地毯。他打电话给玛克辛，恳求她提前结束行程回家，说他需要她为自己撒谎，因为女孩们曾来过他家，如果她不给他提供不在场证明，他就会成为头号嫌疑人。随后，他开始向警官询问关于DNA证据以及它能维持多久的问题，这让他直接陷入了嫌疑之中。

29
00:26:08.000 --> 00:27:25.000
He became paranoid when he learnt the DNA evidence could last a very long time so he went back to Lake and Heath and set Holly and Jessica on fire. He then embraced his role as searcher. He played a keen part in the search and was often seen as being the unofficial leader of a lot of the search parties that were organised and Maxine was only too happy to help. Lying for Ian and giving him his alibi. The families, the community, the entire country, even parts of the world were stricken with grief as the news Holly and Jessica had been found dead. That grief soon turned to anger. Police had to keep the location of Ian and Maxine's secret as vigilante attacks were a legitimate fear. At Maxine's first court appearance her prison fan was pelted with objects. There was a large crowd yelling abuse and threats and they were banging on the side of the van as it went past. And whilst Maxine was at her first court appearance Ian was in a mental health ward pretending to be crazy. His every move was watched and recorded for 50 days in the hospital. Extensive notes were kept and doctors concluded his mental illness was all a shame.
当他得知DNA证据可以保存很长时间时，他变得偏执起来，于是他回到了莱克和希思，放火烧了霍莉和杰西卡。接着，他重新扮演起搜寻者的角色。他在搜寻中发挥了重要作用，经常被视为许多组织起来的搜寻队的非官方领袖，而玛克辛也乐于帮忙。为伊恩撒谎并提供不在场证明。随着霍莉和杰西卡被发现死亡的消息传出，家属、社区、整个国家，甚至世界各地都陷入了悲痛之中。这种悲痛很快转变成了愤怒。警察必须对伊恩和玛克辛的藏身之处保密，因为私刑袭击是一个真实的恐惧。在玛克辛第一次出庭时，她的囚车遭到物品投掷。现场有一大群人叫骂威胁，并在囚车驶过时拍打车身。正当玛克辛第一次出庭时，伊恩则在精神病房里假装疯癫。在医院的50天里，他的一举一动都被监视和记录。医生们留下了详细的记录，并断定他的精神疾病完全是伪装出来的。

30
00:27:25.000 --> 00:28:23.000
Ian was putting on an act and should be treated like every other suspect. They recommended he be sent back to normal custody. He was taken to prison and was met by a huge amount of abuse and threats from the other inmates. He was placed in a specially made isolated cell where he was kept under close watch. But he still managed a near successful suicide attempt. He had to have an urgent stomach pump but he survived. Maxine was also segregated from other prisoners. She tried to starve us off and at one point she had to be force fed through a tube to stay alive. By the time the trial came around more forensic evidence had come to light. Police had found fibres from the Manchester United jerseys in Huntley's home. They found evidence in his car. Plus they had his prints on the bag the girls jerseys were found in. Maxine and Ian were tried together in the same courtroom. Faced with their overwhelming physical evidence Ian was forced to come up with a story.
伊恩是在演戏，应该和其他嫌疑人一样对待。他们建议把他送回普通看守所。他被带到监狱，受到了来自其他犯人的大量辱骂和威胁。他被安置在一个特制的隔离单人牢房里，受到严密监视。但他还是差点成功自杀。他不得不紧急洗胃，但他活了下来。玛克辛也与其他犯人隔离。她试图绝食，一度不得不通过管子强行喂食以维持生命。到了审判之时，更多法医证据浮出水面。警察在亨特利的家中找到了曼联球衣的纤维。他们在他的车里找到了证据。此外，他们还在装有女孩球衣的袋子上找到了他的指纹。玛克辛和伊恩在同一个法庭上受审。面对压倒性的物证，伊恩被迫编造了一个故事。

31
00:28:23.000 --> 00:29:21.000
He admitted the girls were in his house. He said Holly's nose started to bleed so they walked upstairs to the bath which was full of water as he had been washing the dog. Holly sat on the side of the tub and he accidentally bumped into her causing her to fall and hit her head. Jessica started screaming you pushed her so we rushed over to try and quiet her down by grabbing her around the mouth. Accidentally killing her in the process. He then turned around to find Holly had drowned by accident. Huntley took the stand to give this ridiculous account and the many gaping holes in his story were easily exposed. Ian also testified Maxine didn't know that he was responsible for the girls death and when Maxine testified the next day she said Ian's testimony was the first time he said he was responsible for their death. Until that point she believed he was innocent. But many remain unconvinced.
他承认女孩们曾在他的家里。他说霍莉的鼻子开始流血，于是他们上楼走到浴缸旁，当时浴缸里装满了水，因为他一直在给狗洗澡。霍莉坐在浴缸边缘，他一不小心撞到了她，导致她滑倒并撞到了头部。杰西卡开始尖叫“你推了她”，于是我们冲过去，通过捂住她的嘴试图让她安静下来。在这个过程中意外杀死了她。接着他转过身，发现霍莉已经意外溺水身亡。亨特利走上证人席讲述了这番荒谬的供词，他故事中许多巨大的漏洞轻易地就被戳穿了。伊恩还作证说，玛克辛并不知道他是女孩们死亡的责任人，而玛克辛第二天作证时则表示，伊恩的证词是他说自己是责任人的第一次表态。在那之前，她一直相信他是无辜的。但许多人仍然对此持怀疑态度。

32
00:29:21.000 --> 00:30:24.000
Her explanation for doing several extremely detailed house cleans was that she was a clean freak. And I'm not sure what the reason was that she gave her repeatedly referring to the girls in the past tense. She said Ian begged her to lie for him and provide an alibi as police would think it was him even though he didn't do it. She said she knew it wasn't right morally but she thought it was right for Ian as she didn't want him to be accused of something he hadn't done. There was evidence Ian had been frantically trying to clean the house when Maxine arrived home from Grimsby but she said she believed this was done to try and cover up the fact that he had been cheating on her. She made herself out to be a victim of Ian as well. An unwilling pawn. Who can forget the very dramatic scenes in courtroom number one as Maxine Carr giving her evidence from the witness box broke down as she was questioned and said pointing at Ian Huntley across the courtroom. I will not be blamed for what that thing in that box has done to me all those children.
她对多次进行极其细致的房屋清洁的解释是，她是个有洁癖的人。我不知道她反复用过去时态指代那些女孩的原因是什么。她说伊恩恳求她为他撒谎并提供不在场证明，因为警察会认为凶手是他，尽管他并没有杀人。她说她知道从道德上讲这不对，但她觉得这对伊恩来说是对的，因为她不想让他为自己没做过的事情背黑锅。有证据表明，当玛克辛从格里姆斯比回家时，伊恩一直在拼命打扫房子，但她说她相信这是为了掩盖他出轨的事实。把自己塑造成了伊恩的受害者。一个不甘愿的棋子。谁能忘记一号法庭上那些充满戏剧性的场景：玛克辛·卡尔在证人席上作证时情绪崩溃，在接受质问时指着法庭另一头的伊恩·亨特利说：“我不会为那个盒子里的东西对我、对那些孩子所做的一切背黑锅。”

33
00:30:24.000 --> 00:31:12.000
Ian Huntley was found guilty of murder. He was given a life sentence for age count and was given a minimum term of 40 years. Meaning he would be eligible for a lease in 2042 at 68 years of age. Interestingly the jury wasn't unanimous. It was an 11 to 1 count. Maxine Carr was found guilty of providing a false alibi but not guilty of helping conceal the murder. The jury was satisfied she didn't know Ian had killed Jessica and Holly. Maxine was sentenced to three and a half years jail but she only served one year and nine months. When released from prison Maxine was given a new identity. Her appearance was changed with the help of experts and she was placed in a secret location to live.
伊恩·亨特利被裁定谋杀罪名成立。他因数罪并罚被判处终身监禁，最低服刑期为40年。这意味着他将在2042年、即68岁时才有资格获得假释。有趣的是，陪审团并未达成一致意见，投票结果为11比1。玛克辛·卡尔被裁定提供虚假不在场证明罪名成立，但协助隐瞒谋杀罪名不成立。陪审团认为有充分证据表明她并不知晓伊恩杀害了杰西卡和霍莉。玛克辛被判处三年半监禁，但她实际只服刑了一年零九个月。刑满释放后，玛克辛被赋予了新的身份。在专家的帮助下，她的外貌进行了改变，并被安置在一个秘密地点生活。

34
00:31:12.000 --> 00:31:17.000
Her lawyer successfully got a high court injunction banning the press from revealing her new identity or the location she lived. It basically forbade journalists from even trying to find out this information let alone publish it. She was even given police guards to protect against revenge attacks. And of course all this was done at the expense of the taxpayer. Thanks for watching. There aren't comments yet for this episode. Click on any sentence in the transcript to leave a comment.
